.TH DIALOG_RENDER 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
dialog_render \- Draw the box: a translucent black panel with a white outline across the bottom of the logical screen, the speaker in yellow, and up to three word\-wrapped lines of the revealed text
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdialog.h\(dq
.BI "void dialog_render(Dialog *d, Engine *e);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draw the box: a translucent black panel with a white outline across the bottom of the logical screen, the speaker in yellow, and up to three word\-wrapped lines of the revealed text. Text beyond three lines is cut off; keep lines short or split them. Draws nothing when inactive. Call last in render so it sits above the world.
.SH MODULE
dialog (src/engine/dialog/dialog.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dialog_update (3),
.BR text_draw (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
